  "dct_description_sm": [
    "**ADAM ID: **[sm\\_us7000t36n](https://api.adam.geospatial.wfp.org/api/collections/adam.adam_eq_events/items?uid=sm_us7000t36n) Magnitude 5.4 earthquake at 197.18 depth occurred on Jul 24 2026 47 km WNW of San Antonio de los Cobres, Argentina. The epicentre of the earthquake was located at latitude -24.0121 longitude -66.7282. It impacted 1938 people within 50km. WFP’s Automated Disaster Analysis and Mapping (ADAM) system is an operational system for collecting, analysing and mapping geospatial and socio-economic information following sudden onset humanitarian emergencies."
